* sg13g2-lna -- matching-network feasibility study, BASE-FEED WHAT-IF probe
* (issue #186). Generated from
* sim/lna-matching-feasibility/testbench/tb_match_feedprobe.spice.tmpl by
* sim/lna-matching-feasibility/matching_solver.py (gen-char) -- do not edit a
* generated netlist-snapshots/*.spice file, edit this template and re-run.
*
* ONE PVT cell only (hbt_typ / mos_tt / 27 C / 1.80 V). A DESIGN-SPACE
* PROBE, not a candidate and not a proposal to edit design/: it asks how the
* input impedance, the optimum noise source impedance and NFmin move with Le
* when Q1's base-bias feed resistor R3b (330 Ohm from the AC-grounded `bref`
* node) is isolated at RF by an ideal 1 uH choke in series with it. DC is
* unchanged (the choke is a DC short; the OP line below is compared with the
* characterization deck's). Everything else is the committed DUT.
*
* Bench: 50 Ohm `sp` ports (portnum/z0 = 50), `sp lin 1 2.44175e+09 2.44175e+09 1`
* at the band centre per Le value (donoise: NFmin/Rn/SOpt, NFmin referenced
* to the analysis temperature, 300.15 K). `.options gmin=1e-10` as in
* sim/lna-characterization.

.lib "/home/ubuntu/share/pdk/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerHBT.lib" hbt_typ
.lib "/home/ubuntu/share/pdk/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOShv.lib" mos_tt

.options temp=27 tnom=27 gmin=1e-10

** sch_path: /Users/rwalters/GitHub/sg13g2-lna/.loom/worktrees/issue-33/design/lna.sch
.subckt lna vdd vss rfin rfout

*.iopin vdd
*.iopin vss
*.iopin rfin
*.iopin rfout
XQ2 outn vb2 casc vss npn13G2 Nx=8
XQ1 casc b1 e1 vss npn13G2 Nx=8
Le e1 vss 1n m=1
Lc vdd outn 5n m=1
Cin rfin b1 100p m=1
Cout outn rfout 100p m=1
Cbyp2 vb2 vss 100p m=1
Cvdd vdd vss 100p m=1
R2a vdd vb2 1k m=1
R2b vb2 vss 11k m=1
XMb nc_b nc_b vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XQb nc_b nc_a nc_e vss npn13G2 Nx=8
Rp nc_e vss 3.4k m=1
XMa nc_a nc_b vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XQa nc_a nc_a vss vss npn13G2 Nx=1
Rseed vdd nc_a 10meg m=1
XMv vbg nc_b vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=1u ng=1 m=1
Rsum vbg cb3 18.4k m=1
XQc cb3 cb3 vss vss npn13G2 Nx=1
XMnp1 gsvo vbg es vss sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XMnp2 dn vl es vss sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=1u ng=1 m=1
Rtail es vss 9.53k m=1
XMld dn dn vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XMlm gsvo dn vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XMref vl gsvo vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=40u l=1u ng=1 m=1
Rl vl vss 26k m=1
XMis bref gsvo vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=512u l=1u ng=1 m=1
* BENCH EDIT (what-if probe only): R3b's RF path isolated by an ideal 1e-06 H choke
R3b bref b1f 330 m=1
Lfeed b1f b1 1e-06
XQ3 bref bref vss vss npn13G2 Nx=1
Cbref bref vss 100p m=1
.ends


Vdda vdda 0 dc 1.8
Vp1 pin 0 dc 0 ac 1 portnum 1 z0 50
Vp2 pout 0 dc 0 ac 0 portnum 2 z0 50
Xa vdda 0 pin pout lna

.control
pre_osdi /home/ubuntu/share/pdk/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/osdi/psp103.osdi
pre_osdi /home/ubuntu/share/pdk/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/osdi/psp103_nqs.osdi
pre_osdi /home/ubuntu/share/pdk/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/osdi/mosvar.osdi
op
let ic1 = @q.xa.xq1.qnpn13g2[ic]
let ic2 = @q.xa.xq2.qnpn13g2[ic]
let idd = -i(vdda)
echo "OP ic1 $&ic1 ic2 $&ic2 idd $&idd"

* --- ideal-Le sweep, R3b feed choked ---
